{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:vayaazor","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n166.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n166.jpg","n":"72"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:vayaazor/text"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"And He will help, protect and save all who shelter with Him, and let us say: Amen. Let all of you ascribe greatness to our God and honour the Torah, let the Cohen approach. Let there arise . . . Blessed be He, who in His holiness has given the Torah to His people Israel.  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"19","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:vayaazor/quotations/torat"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"8","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:vayaazor/quotations/torat/8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/19/8"}}
{"text":"The Torah of the Lord is flawless, refreshing the soul; the testimony of the Lord is faithful, making the simple wise."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"   "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"19","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:vayaazor/quotations/piqqudei"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"9","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:vayaazor/quotations/piqqudei/9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/19/9"}}
{"text":"The precepts of the Lord are upright, causing the heart to rejoice, the commandment of the Lord is clear, giving light to the eyes."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"   "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"29","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:vayaazor/quotations/oz"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"11","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:vayaazor/quotations/oz/11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/29/11"}}
{"text":"The Lord gives strength to His people, the Lord blesses His people with peace:"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"   "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"18","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:vayaazor/quotations/hael"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"31","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:vayaazor/quotations/hael/31"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/18/31"}}
{"text":"God’s way is perfect, the Lord’s word is pure, a shield is He for all who shelter with Him."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":" "}
